Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:43.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前 在古代中国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long ago, a mythic battle between good and evil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:46.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,发生了一场神话般的正邪之战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}played out in ancient China.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:49.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,内战的战火席卷了整个国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The country was torn by civil war,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:52.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,各诸侯国为了土地和权力征战不断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with many kingdoms struggling for land and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:01:00.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,其中有一个王更野心勃勃 想要通过武力一统天下成为皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But one king had a ruthless ambition to make himself emperor by the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:06.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要把它连成万里 连一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to make it a million miles, make it a...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:25.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,都退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:27.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备开战!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for war!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:32.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他诸侯国唯恐被他吞并\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other rulers hired assassins to kill the King
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:35.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,派出杀手刺杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before he could conquer them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:16.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用!朕没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! I am not harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:25.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚进攻!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We attack tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:44.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的军队一路战胜了一个又一个诸侯国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kingdom by kingdom, his army swept away everything in its path,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:48.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,胆敢违抗他的人都没好下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and anyone who resisted met a terrible fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:52.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,最后整个国家都是他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The country was his.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:56.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,他成了一切万物的统治者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was now Emperor of All Under Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:03:02.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,战败的敌人都成了他的奴隶 为他建造万里长城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He enslaved his conquered enemies and forced them to build his Great Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:06.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,一旦他们死了或病了 就直接掩埋在城墙下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they were dead or useless, he had them buried beneath it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:42.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,方士教会了皇帝如何掌握五行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor's mystics taught him mastery over the five elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:47.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,火 水 土 木 金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fire, water, earth, wood and metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:49.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的力量无限壮大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His power seemed without limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:56.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,成为了万人的主宰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was master of millions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:59.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,然而就如最低贱的贱民一样 他渐渐变老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but like the lowliest peasant, he could not stop growing old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:05.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,朕 要寻找永生之道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have too much to do for one lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:09.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,他要击败他的最后一个敌人 死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needed to defeat his last enemy, death itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:20.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,直到有一天 他听到传闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, news came of a powerful witch
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:23.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个道姑知道长生不老的秘方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was rumoured to know the secret to eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:29.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,于是他命令自己的老朋友 忠实的部下明将军去找这个道姑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ordered General Ming, his oldest friend and trusted ally, to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:42.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个道姑名叫紫苑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The witch was named Zi Yuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:45.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,她跟明将军所想的不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she was nothing like the General expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:56.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,参见陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:03.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,平身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rise up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:10.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇上所求 奴婢不知如何解答…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not possess the secret of immortality, my Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:13.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,…却知答案藏于何处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I know where to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:15.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,将军…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:20.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,此女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No man is to touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:23.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,非朕莫属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:32.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,在西面边陲有一座吐鲁番寺庙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the western border stood the Monastery of Turfan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:36.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是古代藏书最多的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was housed the greatest library in the ancient world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:41.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,紫苑相信不老的秘方就藏于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Zi Yuan was sure the secret to eternal life was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:07.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,此乃开锁之物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:18.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是一块失传已久的甲骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the long lost oracle bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:23.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,记载了古时的所有秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a collection of all the mystical secrets of the ancient world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:28.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇帝所要的答案就在里面 其中还隐藏了其他超凡的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor's answer was here along with other magic beyond imagining.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:42.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,朕甚悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have served me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:47.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,汝何所求 朕皆赐之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will grant you anything you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:52.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,愿与郭明共渡余生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to spend my life with General Ming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:56.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:18.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,她用皇帝听不懂的梵语念诵着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She cast the spell in Sanskrit,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:22.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种古老语言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an ancient language that the Emperor did not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:30.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,此语朕虽不解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel your spell working.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:37.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,然觉于气 流行于筋络之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am now immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:42.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,朕要你见一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:55.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,郭郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guo Ming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:01.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,为朕的皇后 可饶其不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Become my queen and I will let him live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:05.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,从其令 卿之命为重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what he says! Save yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你必食言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never keep your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:14.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:30.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,与郭明地府相见吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, join General Ming in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你竟敢施法于朕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare you cast a law on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:48.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对朕做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:51.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,咒汝及汝之徒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cursed you and your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.37,0:09:07.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,快护驾!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surround the Palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇上出事了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor is in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:28.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,咒语绝对不能解除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The curse must never be lifted,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:33.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,否则皇帝会重返人间 奴役众人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the Emperor will rise again to enslave all of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.11,0:09:37.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,那天来临时 也将是世界末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On that dark day, there will be nothing and no one to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:44.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,《木乃伊3：龙帝之墓》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:55.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以跑 但你无处可藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can run, but you can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:03.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,一点钟方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:05.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,英国牛津郡 1946年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OXFORDSHIRE, ENGLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:10.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,十点钟 一点钟 十点钟 一…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten o'clock, one o'clock. Ten o'clock, one...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,这就是成人该做的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is something for grown men to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:34.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,靠这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bite on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙 我回来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evy, I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:57.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥康纳夫人去读书会了 先生 她会回来吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs O'Connell is at her book reading, sir. She'll be home for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:01.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好的 非常好 正好我钓了鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, right. Well, that's great, 'cause we're having fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没想到我会钓到 是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't think I'd catch anything, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:09.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对你绝对有信心 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had the utmost confidence, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:16.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的脖子上有个鱼钩 先生 要我帮你去拿钢丝钳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a hook in your neck, sir. Shall I fetch the wire cutters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:26.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,里克…退后!跟着我! 快!快!快!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick... Fall back! Follow me! Move! Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:32.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,"最后安全登上飞艇 木乃伊终于被打败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Now safely aboard the airship with the mummy finally vanquished,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:34.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,(伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:37.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,达什将斯嘉丽拥入怀中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash swept Scarlet into his arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:43.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 斯嘉丽 我以为失去你了 曾有一时 确实如此"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, Scarlet, I thought I'd lost you. For a moment there, you did."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:46.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,沐浴在金色阳光下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bathed in rays of golden sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:51.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的英雄们激情拥吻庆祝着重逢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our heroes sealed their reunion with a kiss of timeless passion,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:55.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们的爱比以往更深更真"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their love deeper and truer than ever."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:04.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥康纳夫人 我们都非常好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs O'Connell, we're all dying to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:07.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯嘉丽?奥凯弗这个角色的原形真的是你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the Scarlet O'Keefe character really based on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:12.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,老实说 她和我是截然不同的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I can say she's a completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:14.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有问题吗? - 奥康纳夫人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any more questions? -  Mrs O'Connell...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:19.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥康纳夫人 你如今的生活与战前一样精彩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs O'Connell, is your life today as exciting as it was before the war?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:23.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,但愿我的生活能和那时一样精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish my life were that exciting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:24.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个系列还会出新书吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will there be another book in the series?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:27.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,会有大团圆结局吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe in happy endings?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:32.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样不是很幸福吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this blissful?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:36.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,一起在家吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dinner at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:40.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 每天晚上 - 每天晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Every night. - Every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:44.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 为了退休干杯 - 希望永远这么幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here's to retirement. - May we stay this happy forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:02.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,还是没有亚历克斯的信 上个月我给他寄了3封\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still no letter from Alex. I've sent him three in the last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:03.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,是嘛 你还想怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, what do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:04.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他只有被赶出学校或是缺钱时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only time we ever hear from that kid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:07.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,才会寄信回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is when he's getting kicked out of college or he needs more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:10.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我相信他正埋头于学习中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure he's just buried in his studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:20.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不说了 你的读书会怎么样? - 哦 很好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, how did your book reading go? - Oh, fine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:24.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过他们问起我:"什么时候会出新的木乃伊探险记"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until they asked me, "When will there be another Mummy adventure?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:27.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你确实向出版社保证过会出第三本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but you did promise the publisher a third book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:28.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:33.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,可我整晚盯着白纸 脑子一片空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I spend my nights staring at a blank page, completely blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:38.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我们不吃了 上楼去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could skip dinner, and I could
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:43.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会试着启发你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}attempt to inspire you upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:47.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你真好 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's so sweet of you, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:52.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,可我还是想坐在打字机前 直到灵感涌现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm going to sit at that typewriter until something exciting comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:56.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:00.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,鲑鱼 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trout. How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:08.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你找到个不用枪的爱好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so happy you found a hobby that doesn't involve guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:18.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,中国宁夏省\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}NINGXIA PROVINCE, CHINA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:32.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,一定能找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, we'll find the entrance today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:36.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,李彤 午饭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Li Tung, what's for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:37.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,热的汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noodle soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:39.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好 威尔逊回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Wilson's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你晚了好几天 教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a couple days late, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:52.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你碰上抢劫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was beginning to think you'd run into bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我亲爱的朋友 谢谢你的关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my dear fellow, thank you for the concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:56.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你渴吗? - 哦 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you thirsty? - Oh, yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:58.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you go. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:01.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 看见你站在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when I saw you standing up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.85,0:15:04.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是你父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I was looking at your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是里克?奥康纳的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really are Rick O'Connell's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:10.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊真希望从今以后 人们会称呼他亚历克斯?奥康纳的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, hopefully after today, he'll be known as Alex O'Connell's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:13.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,多有力的脸啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a powerful face!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:17.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我告诉博物馆的同事 你发现了兵马俑时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I told my colleagues at the museum that you had discovered the Colossus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们非常震惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.37,0:15:21.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃 但是… - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, however... - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:23.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候我能进那个墓穴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When am I gonna get in that tomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,别为那些事烦心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the buggers get you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:28.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,是你发现了本布里奇的日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was you that discovered the Bembridge journal,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:30.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,有了它 你很快会找到龙帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and with it, you'll discover the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:34.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我对你绝对有信心 亚历克斯 - 谢谢你 教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have complete faith in you, Alex. - Thank you, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:37.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for believing in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:42.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,找到了!找到了!找到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found it! We found the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:46.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌的木乃伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:49.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,可憎的木乃伊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vile Mummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:56.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 受诅咒的木乃伊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Cursed Mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:15:59.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,神秘的木乃伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mysterious Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:04.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶的木乃伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Malignant Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:10.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,受死吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,拿命来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:23.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,里克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:27.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:40.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我等着灵感涌现呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready to be inspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:50.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,还记得那次木乃伊把我捆住吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember the time the mummy had me tied down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:54.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后你来救我 切断了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you came to save me and you cut...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:59.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!你扯断了绳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! You tore open the ropes is what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:02.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,就在他插入…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just as he was about to plunge his...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:06.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:35.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:44.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 龙帝不欢迎客人 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Emperor didn't want any houseguests. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,注意!不要走散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:14.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,科林?本布里奇爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Colin Bembridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:16.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 啊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, gee...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:19.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,70年前他来到这个墓穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went searching for this tomb 70 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:22.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,他这样子应该是个警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They left him like this as a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:24.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,很不幸 这并不是那个能让我们出名的死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, this is not the dead man that's gonna make us famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:26.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:04.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,看啊亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at it, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:07.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,看啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:47.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,楚旺!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chu Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:32.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 楚旺 - 不 不 不要 不要 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chu Wah. - No, no, don't, don't, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:35.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 亚历克斯 他们死了!走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, Alex, they're dead! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:38.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,那里很危险 你比任何人都清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This kind of danger goes with the territory. You know that better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.07,0:20:40.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:46.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯? - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:47.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:52.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好小子 很好 哦 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, good chap. Okay. Good chap. Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:21:01.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有的士兵都面向这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the warriors are facing in to this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:04.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 就像在等待龙帝的命令 - 那么 他又在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- as if awaiting an order from the Emperor. - Well, then, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:09.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你不会以为是某些凶暴的盗墓者 攻击了我们把战利品拿走了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you don't think some bloody grave robber's beaten us to the prize, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:11.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 他还在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:14.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,看 这是风水罗盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, this is a feng shui compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:25.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊现在 这…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Now. This...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:27.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,看 这是真正的北方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is true north,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.57,0:21:31.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,但风水罗盘却指向相反方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the feng shui compass is set in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:34.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊我们得调整一下 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, we need to realign it. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.08,0:21:36.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我们来 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, here we go. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:01.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯!亚历克斯 回话!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex! Alex, speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:03.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.57,0:22:07.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 亚历克斯! - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alex! - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:10.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 怎么找到龙帝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, have we found the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.62,0:22:15.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:24.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:27.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是自图坦卡门法老墓以来的唯一最大发现!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only the greatest find since King Tut!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:35.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,"若他醒来 将是世界末日"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If he is awakened, all mortals should despair."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:37.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's definitely him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.11,0:22:44.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,连他的妃子都得陪葬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even had his concubines buried alive with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:46.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,自私的混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selfish bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:49.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 威尔逊教授 你不下来看看吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Professor Wilson, you want to come down and take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.86,0:22:53.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,还是你激动地连话都说不了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or are you so overwhelmed you can't talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.97,0:23:18.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,威尔逊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wilson!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:32.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 教授 还有很多事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, Professor. We've got a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:33.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.77,0:24:41.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,首先 谨代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First of all, I'd just like to say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:44.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,外交部感谢你们在战时所做的贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the Foreign Office appreciates all that you did during the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.81,0:24:49.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过派我来是为了交给你们最后一个任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've been sent to offer you one last assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:54.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕我们已经从谍报游戏中退休了 不是吗 亲爱的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid we've retired from the espionage game, haven't we, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:56.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们已经…我们再也不做了 我们退休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we've... We don't do that any more. We're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.57,0:24:58.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 完全结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not at all. - Completely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:04.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过我好奇问问 这次任务是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But just out of curiosity, what is the mission anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.25,0:25:07.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要你们把这个送到上海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you to courier this to Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.05,0:25:14.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好漂亮的冰片 - 这是香格里拉之眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice piece of ice. - It's the Eye of Shangri-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.51,0:25:18.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,传说它能指引通向永生泉之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you believe the legend, it points the way to the Pool of Eternal Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.10,0:25:20.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,1940年从中国被盗出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was smuggled out of China in 1940.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.35,0:25:23.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在政府想要把它归还给上海博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the government would like to return it to the Shanghai Museum
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.18,0:25:26.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,以示对中国人民的友好诚意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a sign of good faith to the Chinese people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:30.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到你们在这方面的经验 自然就想到了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with your expertise in the field, we naturally thought of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.69,0:25:33.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这真是我们的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we'd be so flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.70,0:25:39.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,但里克和我在战后互相许诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Rick and I, we made a promise to each other after the war
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.62,0:25:42.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们会安顿下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we would settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.79,0:25:45.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 我们做到了 不是吗?我们… - 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right, yeah, we did, didn't we? We... - I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.71,0:25:48.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过我得承认我有点失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I must admit I am a little disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.71,0:25:52.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,战后的中国很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Postwar China is very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.21,0:25:57.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,有很多派别会插足香格里拉之眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a lot of factions that would love to get their hands on the Eye of Shangri-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.22,0:26:00.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,有可能香格里拉之眼会永远消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In lesser hands, the Eye could be lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:03.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能让这种事发生 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We couldn't let that happen, could we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.39,0:26:05.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊这对世界来说太糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that could be bad for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.89,0:26:08.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 世界…太可怕了 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The world... Terrible. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.15,0:26:10.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 她有个哥哥住在上海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, she has a brother who lives in Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.82,0:26:12.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 乔纳森! - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jonathan! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.73,0:26:14.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,他经营着一家夜总会 我没记错的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He owns a nightclub, if I'm not mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.69,0:26:16.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直想去看看他 我们可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been meaning to visit. We could...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:17.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该…顺便去看他 给他个惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should...drop in and surprise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.61,0:26:19.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 问候一下 - 为什么不呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Say hello. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.37,0:26:22.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是否表示 我们能指望你们的最后一次帮忙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this mean we can count on you one last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.00,0:26:25.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.71,0:26:30.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,中国上海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SHANGHAI, CHINA
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.54,0:26:32.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,1947年春节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CHINESE NEW YEAR, 1947
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:00.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:04.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,敬你一杯 公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's to you, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.45,0:27:07.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了伊姆贺特普 愿天下太平!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Imhotep. May the bugger actually stay dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.96,0:27:10.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,丁当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ding-dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.51,0:27:20.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 能请我喝杯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, can you buy a drink for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.84,0:27:24.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,失陪一下 亚历克斯!亚历克斯!你又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Alex! Alex! You're back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.85,0:27:26.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,过来 亚历克斯 请你喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, Alex. Let me get you a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.39,0:27:28.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,给这小子来杯温和点的 哈?探险家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smooth special for the pup, huh? The explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.06,0:27:32.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,来两杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make that two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:35.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 乔叔叔 但那女人搭讪了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Uncle Jon, but I got a better offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:38.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 亚历克斯 不 听我说 我怎么能…过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, Alex. No, look. Listen, how can I... Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.95,0:27:40.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,用考古学的话来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To put it in archaeological terms,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.82,0:27:43.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是一个埋了许多法老王的墓穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's a tomb in which many pharaohs have lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.12,0:27:46.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在 听着 听着 为我考虑下 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, listen, listen, just think about me for a moment, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.12,0:27:49.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的发现几天后就会公诸于世 而你的父母肯定会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your discovery will go public in a few days, and your parents are sure to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.00,0:27:52.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,对于你的辍学 他们不会高兴的 而且…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not gonna be happy you've dropped out of school. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.63,0:27:56.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 乔叔叔?好吗? 我在这 而他们在很远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you relax, Uncle Jon? Okay? I'm here. They're a long way away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.55,0:27:59.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 亚历克斯… - 我走了 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alex... - Excuse me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.47,0:28:01.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还要去挖掘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some excavation to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:11.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,乔纳森!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.52,0:28:18.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们来中国了!伊芙 里克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in China! Evy. Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.78,0:28:21.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们在…这真是…我甚至没有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you... It's so... I didn't even...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.24,0:28:24.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥 见到你真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother, how lovely to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:26.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他在这!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no idea he was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.37,0:28:27.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁在这? - 谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who was here? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.79,0:28:31.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,每次都这样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This happens every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.79,0:28:34.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,酒吧里的每个人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every man in the bar!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.04,0:28:36.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸? - 亚历克斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? - Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.21,0:28:37.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道该拿你怎么办! - 他还是个孩子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know what to do with you! - He's just a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.96,0:28:41.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 10分钟内我不能离开这房间! - 我不能…走开!去死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't leave the room for 10 minutes! - I didn't... Go away! Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:43.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我受够了! - 我们去找帅哥吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sick of it! - Let's go get lover-boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.51,0:28:45.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想杀了你 小子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill you, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.55,0:28:47.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,别妄想了 那是我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so fast, that's my kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.89,0:28:53.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 疯狗马奎尔? - 跳飞奥康纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mad Dog Maguire? - Ricochet O'Connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.64,0:28:56.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 嘿 - 你在这干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, hey. - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.23,0:28:59.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 亚历克斯!甜心!你还好吧? - 只是家庭聚会而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alex! Sweetheart! Are you all right? - Just a little family get-together, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.19,0:29:02.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们继续狂欢 音乐!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's get back to having a good time. Music!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:04.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,有多久了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.24,0:29:07.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,1923年 埃及 法国对外志愿军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Egypt, '23. French Foreign Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.45,0:29:10.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙可随地降落飞机 你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy could land a plane on anything, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.50,0:29:13.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么在这? - 跳飞 他居然敢泡我的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you here? - Ricochet, he had his hands all over me girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:15.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在 不管是不是你儿子 我都要教训他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, son or no son, I gotta give him a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:17.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 让开 爸爸 - 坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out of the way, Dad. - Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.00,0:29:20.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我更希望你能教他点更有用的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now as much as I'd really like you to teach him a valuable lesson...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.84,0:29:22.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的妈妈会很伤心 非常伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His mother would be upset! Very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.59,0:29:24.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,你得好好解释下 年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a lot of explaining to do, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:25.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有了妻子和孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a wife now, and a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.51,0:29:27.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,情况有点不同了 相信你能明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are a little bit different, I'm sure you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.76,0:29:29.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 我向你道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Let me make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.77,0:29:32.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,在这看到你我们很惊讶 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just surprised to see you here. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.98,0:29:34.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁来负责赔偿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna pay for all this damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.48,0:29:35.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.85,0:29:36.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我才来了5分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here five minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.98,0:29:38.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,就帮你收拾烂摊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm already pulling your fanny out of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.94,0:29:39.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,你必须回学校去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going back to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.07,0:29:43.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得可能吗 爸爸? 你们俩突然出现 到底要干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you think this was gonna work, Dad? You two show up, tell me what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:47.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们一家人应该坐下好好谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. But we should sit down and discuss this like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.87,0:29:50.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅 妈妈 但我们不像一家人很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No offence, Mom, but we haven't been a family in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.74,0:29:52.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 别扭头就跑 亚历克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't you turn your back on me. Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.87,0:29:55.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 只是…亚历克斯 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, just... Alex, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.21,0:29:58.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:02.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要那样看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.09,0:30:10.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 都是你的错! - 我的错?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all your fault! - My fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.56,0:30:12.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你老是宠着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one that's always smothering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.35,0:30:14.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,你连不帮他擦鼻子五分钟都做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't leave him alone for five minutes without wiping his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.98,0:30:18.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你从来都不关心他的生活 所以我才过度补偿他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I was overcompensating for the fact that you never took an interest in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.81,0:30:21.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的生活是我的头等大事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His life was my top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.57,0:30:24.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,多少次我给他收拾烂摊子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times did I save that kid from breaking his neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.24,0:30:26.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,一点温暖和鼓励就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little warmth and encouragement would have been nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.57,0:30:29.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是他的父亲 这是不能改变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm his father. It's implied.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.45,0:30:36.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们一生都在寻找奇珍异宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've spent our entire lives searching for priceless artefacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.37,0:30:37.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,而对我们最珍贵的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the one thing that's most precious to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.04,0:30:39.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们却失去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.79,0:30:45.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能让亚历克斯变成某个陌生人 而照片却挂在我们的壁炉架上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let Alex become some stranger in pictures on our mantle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.55,0:30:48.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们不能让那发生 - 不 我们不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can't let that happen. - No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.38,0:30:50.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们该如何弥补?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we gonna fix this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.10,0:30:54.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须齐心协力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.81,0:31:05.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,中国西部准军事哨所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PARAMILITARY OUTPOST WESTERN CHINA
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.76,0:31:32.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥康纳一家人已经到上海了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The O'Connells are in Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.14,0:31:35.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们拿到神眼了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do they have the Eye of Shangri-La?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.72,0:31:38.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们的线人已经证实这件事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our spy says they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.60,0:31:39.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.85,0:31:41.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,召集军队!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assemble the troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.10,0:31:42.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.65,0:31:47.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,弟兄们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:51.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们所做的训练和牺牲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon all our training and sacrifice...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.37,0:31:54.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,很快就可以得到丰盛的成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will bear great fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.95,0:31:59.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,重振皇威是我多年的夙愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my dream to raise our Emperor from his tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.91,0:32:03.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,平定天下非吾皇莫属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only He can bring order out of this chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.09,0:32:05.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soldiers...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.34,0:32:10.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的圣战蓄势待发!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tonight our great battle begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.23,0:32:24.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 坐黄包车都比这快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this might have been faster if we took a rickshaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.81,0:32:27.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是中国的春节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Chinese New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.23,0:32:28.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不正是喜欢这个国家吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you just love this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.36,0:32:31.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,这有着那么多特别的节日 还一定要喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have so many extra little holidays, and drinking is mandatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.82,0:32:34.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,难以相信我们要去看你的第一大发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe we get to see your first big discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.49,0:32:35.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,太兴奋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.62,0:32:38.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,经昨晚后 我还以为你们根本不想看呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, after last night, I'm surprised you want to see it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.58,0:32:42.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着 一个小时后我来接你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'll pick you up in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:43.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.67,0:32:47.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 我这辈子看够木乃伊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I've seen enough mummies to last a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.31,0:32:59.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.39,0:33:03.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的 多震惊啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my darling, very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.77,0:33:06.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,你打算什么时候打开石棺?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do you get to open the sarcophagus?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.56,0:33:08.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,等官方的正式文书下来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, after the official red tape has been cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.69,0:33:11.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩不知道"安息"这两字吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do the words "rest in peace" mean anything to you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.07,0:33:15.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 你何不在这多留几天呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Mom, why don't you stick around for the next few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.87,0:33:17.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起打开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we can open it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.20,0:33:18.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like that very much, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.70,0:33:21.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 为什么不去告诉威尔逊教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, why don't you go and tell Professor Wilson
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.08,0:33:23.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这 你知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we're here. You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.25,0:33:24.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.71,0:33:27.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我离开的时候可不要把上面那家伙叫醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't wake the big guy up while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.63,0:33:36.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.72,0:33:41.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 这一切真的是一个大发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this is all really, really big stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.81,0:33:46.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,随你怎么说 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you say, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.89,0:34:25.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.14,0:34:31.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚你真是光彩夺目我很久没见过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just have a certain glow about you this evening I haven't seen in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.69,0:34:35.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想这多亏了木乃伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess mummies bring out the best in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.82,0:34:40.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,在开罗失之交臂?抱歉打扰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a wrong turn at Cairo? Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.99,0:34:43.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗杰 - 罗杰?威尔逊教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger. - Professor Roger Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.04,0:34:45.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,里克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.45,0:34:49.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 当亚历克斯告诉我你也参与时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when Alex told me that you had gone legit,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.08,0:34:51.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,别提我有多惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just couldn't believe my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.21,0:34:54.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我只是以保护的名义挖掘墓穴而已 伊芙琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now I just pillage tombs in the name of preservation. Evelyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.01,0:34:59.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜你的最新发现 - 这都是亚历克斯的功劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Congratulations on your latest discovery. - Alex deserves all the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.22,0:35:01.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是个厉害的孩子 我把他当自己儿子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's one hell of a kid. He's like the son I never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.39,0:35:02.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们就只有他这么一个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's the only one we've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.81,0:35:04.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以下次你派他去实地考察时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so the next time you send him on one of your field trips,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.93,0:35:06.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,请先知会我们一声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you give us the heads-up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.31,0:35:08.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.77,0:35:12.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想你们拿了我们的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, I believe you have something that belongs to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.27,0:35:13.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.94,0:35:15.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是说这个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.24,0:35:20.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.37,0:35:24.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,给 拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.29,0:35:26.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的 罗杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All yours, Rog.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.04,0:35:29.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道能信任你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I could rely on you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.25,0:35:35.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你们的任务还没完成 奥康纳先生和夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid your work is not done yet, Mr and Mrs O'Connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.42,0:35:39.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我来给你们介绍个朋友 杨将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to introduce you to a friend of mine. General Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.43,0:35:40.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗杰!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.09,0:35:45.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是他资助亚历克斯这次的挖掘 我们是一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he is the man who financed Alex's dig. We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.31,0:35:48.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,并肩战友 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheek by jowl. General.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.31,0:35:51.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,搜他身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.73,0:35:57.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 神眼属于中国人民 你们不能这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. The Eye belongs to the Chinese people. You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.94,0:36:02.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗杰你个小人 你收了多少…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Rog, you snake, how much did...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.53,0:36:05.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,是阴阳?…给你钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it Yin and Yang?...pay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.41,0:36:07.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了确保是你们俩送来神眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough to pull strings at the Foreign Office,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.04,0:36:12.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在外交部可下了一番功夫 转过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make sure that it was you two who delivered the Eye. Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.54,0:36:16.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,神眼里含有永生泉的泉水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eye contains the elixir from the Pool of Eternal Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.63,0:36:21.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要你打开它 奥康纳夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to open it, Mrs O'Connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.68,0:36:23.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.64,0:36:26.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要用它来唤醒龙帝 对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to use it to wake the Emperor, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.06,0:36:31.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有他的兵马俑军队 这是我们的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his Terracotta Army. At least, that's the general idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.31,0:36:34.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,唤醒一支木乃伊军队真是疯了 听着 杨…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raising an army of mummies is insane. Listen, Yang...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.57,0:36:40.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,老实点!给我老实点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy! Go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.15,0:36:44.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,打开石棺 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to open the sarcophagus. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.83,0:36:52.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,念铭文!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read the inscription! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.26,0:37:02.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,中国古文不是我的强项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ancient Chinese isn't my forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.05,0:37:06.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来需要点刺激 威尔逊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's some encouragement. Wilson!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:08.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我念!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.89,0:37:12.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 伊芙 不要念! 他们最后还是会杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Evy, don't do it! They're just gonna kill me, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.61,0:37:19.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,铭文上说 只有拥有纯洁之心的人的一滴血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The inscription says that only a drop of blood
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.44,0:37:22.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,才能打开神眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a person of pure heart can open the Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:26.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的丈夫说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your husband was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.53,0:37:30.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.88,0:37:41.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有心灵纯洁才会为所爱之人牺牲自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the pure of heart would sacrifice themselves for the one they love.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.76,0:37:44.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.26,0:37:52.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,上次见面后你就没找过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never called after our last date.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.27,0:37:54.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,没时间开玩笑 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have time for games, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.69,0:37:58.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我的名字 而我却不知道你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know my name, but I don't know yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.15,0:37:59.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我叫琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.44,0:38:02.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是来向我解释要杀我的原因吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to explain to me why you tried to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.07,0:38:04.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.28,0:38:06.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,或者我们可以去救你的父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or we could save your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.08,0:38:13.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,威尔逊 你个狗娘养的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wilson, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.05,0:39:09.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续 奥康纳 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get on with it, O'Connell. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.40,0:39:33.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,一旦龙帝接触到这个 就会复活重新统治天下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once this touches him, the Emperor will rise to rule again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.04,0:39:36.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.66,0:40:18.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 求你了!不要 那是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, please! Don't. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.62,0:40:20.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't, don't. Don't, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.96,0:40:23.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要 亚历克斯 是我 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't, Alex, it's me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.09,0:40:27.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是他 这是个太监!这是圈套!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not him. This is a eunuch! It's a decoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.84,0:40:31.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,龙帝到底在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell's the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.20,0:40:59.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,呆着!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.31,0:41:19.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.28,0:41:34.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇上 我是来保护你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live to serve you, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.24,0:41:35.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮你获得永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help you become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.91,0:41:38.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你说谎 随时烧死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you are lying, you will burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.34,0:41:59.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等!等等!等我下!我和你一起走!等等 等等…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait! You wait for me! I'm coming with you! Wait, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.50,0:42:26.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.17,0:42:36.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得快去阻止那个木乃伊! 时间越长 他们越强大!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to put this mummy down fast! The longer we wait, the stronger they get!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.18,0:42:38.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,打开大门!打开大门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the gate! Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.85,0:42:45.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,侬想死啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.85,0:42:49.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 是 是 我知道 抱歉 朋友 有个木乃伊被放出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah, I know. Sorry, pal. There's a mummy on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.77,0:42:51.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来开车? - 为什么不呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanna drive? - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.15,0:42:52.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 我爱上一个开卡车的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I love a woman who can drive a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.03,0:42:56.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 朋友 非常抱歉 但你知道吗? 新年快乐!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, pal, I'm really sorry, but you know what? Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.45,0:42:57.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,快开车 宝贝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit it, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.08,0:43:04.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!让开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Move over!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.08,0:43:07.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么?不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.83,0:43:09.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.26,0:43:17.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.14,0:43:21.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 乔纳森 上车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Jonathan, get in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.01,0:43:24.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉毁了你的车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about the Rolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.22,0:43:26.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们真像木乃伊磁铁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are like mummy magnets!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.31,0:43:30.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你得转过来! - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to turn you around! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.78,0:43:38.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.66,0:43:43.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我们可以用这个! - 给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, we could use this! - Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.70,0:43:49.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 是啊主意真不错 - 真大啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yeah, that's a better idea. - Size counts!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.21,0:43:52.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,别逗了!他们要跑远了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop mucking about! They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.04,0:43:54.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,开好车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.46,0:43:57.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 瞄准龙帝! - 瞄准龙帝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aim for the Emperor! - Aim for the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.76,0:44:00.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点上 乔纳森! - 我在点啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Light it up, Jonathan! - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.51,0:44:01.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.28,0:44:23.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,打中了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.87,0:44:25.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 着火了! - 什么 还来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fire! - What, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.08,0:44:28.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你屁股着火了! - 我的屁股?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your ass is on fire! - My ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.08,0:44:29.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要动! - 里克 我屁股着火了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold still! - Rick, my ass is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.04,0:44:31.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 拍我的… - 弄熄它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, spank my... - I'm putting it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.58,0:44:33.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮我弄熄 里克! - 叫你不要动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put me out, Rick! - Just hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.42,0:44:35.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,拍我的屁股!拍我的屁股!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spank my ass! Spank my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.80,0:44:37.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.72,0:44:42.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.72,0:44:49.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.35,0:44:51.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.69,0:44:53.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙 你去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evy, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.90,0:44:56.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 抄近路! - 伊芙!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Taking a short cut! - Evy!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.49,0:45:07.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟你说了这是近路! - 是啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you it was a short cut! - Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.62,0:45:09.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,换他追我们了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's chasing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.00,0:45:15.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.42,0:45:19.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我 给 你会需要这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand. Here, you're gonna need these.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.17,0:45:21.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不用等我 - 你去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't wait up for me. - Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.13,0:45:22.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.39,0:45:31.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 里克呢? - 你觉得他会去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Rick? - Where do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.27,0:45:38.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.78,0:45:44.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.45,0:45:53.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 把手给我 上马来! - 回去 爸爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me your hand and get on this horse! - Get back, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:58.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历山大?鲁珀特?奥康纳 立即给我坐到马后面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexander Rupert O'Connell, you get on the back of this horse this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.51,0:46:11.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,让开!让开!哦 天哪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way! Get out of the way! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.94,0:46:20.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.19,0:46:22.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得回去帮里克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to go back and help Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.86,0:46:25.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,里克!忘了里克!他们来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick! Forget Rick! Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.29,0:46:35.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我去追龙帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go after the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.04,0:46:38.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 对付木乃伊 我更在行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. I've got a little more experience with mummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.88,0:46:42.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我拿着唯一可以杀死他的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have the only weapon that can kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.46,0:46:44.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我掩护你 上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'll cover you. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.22,0:46:54.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,琳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.12,0:47:14.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以为你死了! - 他打偏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought you were dead! - He missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.81,0:47:43.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.49,0:48:34.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 里克 你能去付钱吗? - 我像带钱包的人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, Rick. Could you get the cab? - Does it look like I have a wallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.05,0:48:55.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我差点就杀了龙帝 要不是你们俩暴露了我的行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I would have killed the Emperor if you two hadn't blown my cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.89,0:48:57.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,一切皆在我掌控之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had everything under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.22,0:48:59.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是嘛 我们就是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, that's exactly what we were thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.56,0:49:01.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊动作真快 你又复活了一个木乃伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, good going, you raised another mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.48,0:49:03.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,而这混蛋还有超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this bugger's got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.52,0:49:06.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,他能控制火 水 金 天晓得还有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got control over fire, water, metal and who knows what else.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.86,0:49:07.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你却把他挖了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you dug him up anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.03,0:49:09.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你不会想把这个也怪到我头上吧 爸爸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you're not gonna pin this one on me, okay, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.86,0:49:12.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是我吗? - 哦 住口 你们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Am I? - Oh, stop it, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.20,0:49:15.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是谁的错 是威尔逊利用了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's to blame here. Wilson manipulated all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.70,0:49:16.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.91,0:49:19.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我为我父母向你道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologise for my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.08,0:49:21.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过我觉得我们合作地还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I thought we worked really well together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.42,0:49:24.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,除了没杀成龙帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except we failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.38,0:49:29.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们还没互相介绍过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, we haven't been properly introduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.76,0:49:32.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你到底是谁? - 我叫琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you exactly? - My name is Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.43,0:49:35.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,几个世纪以来我的家族一直看守着龙帝的墓穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family has watched over the Emperor's tomb for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.89,0:49:40.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有用这个刺穿龙帝的心脏才能杀死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor cannot be killed unless he is stabbed through the heart with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.31,0:49:43.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我母亲很久以前就在这上面下了咒语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother put a curse on it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.40,0:49:45.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.40,0:49:49.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,过来 简短开下家庭会议 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a quick family meeting, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.78,0:49:52.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 坐 - 下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sit. - Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.36,0:49:56.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对这女孩了解多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you really know about this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.45,0:50:01.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是很了解 但经过今晚她的帮助 我愿意相信她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not much, but after her help tonight, I'm willing to go on a little faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.29,0:50:03.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 相信 - 没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Faith. - Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.25,0:50:05.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真的不懂什么叫私人空间吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't really believe in the concept of personal space, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.83,0:50:09.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,若龙帝到达香格里拉 喝下永生泉水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Emperor reaches Shangri-La and drinks from the Pool of Eternal Life,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.42,0:50:12.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,他会唤醒他的军队 到时大家都完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he will raise his army and no one will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.38,0:50:14.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像我想永远年轻英俊一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much as I'd like to stay this boyishly handsome forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.01,0:50:16.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,香格里拉只是个传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shangri-La is a crock.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.55,0:50:18.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊以前你也是这么说木乃伊的 乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but that's what you used to say about mummies, too, Jon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.60,0:50:20.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 真会开脱啊 - 你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You did pretty well off it. - Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.81,0:50:25.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,香格里拉的入口位于喜马拉雅山的高处山口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Gateway to Shangri-La lies in a mountain pass high in the Himalayas.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.31,0:50:27.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,远处是一座金塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond it is a golden tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.56,0:50:31.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,一旦钻石放到顶部就会指出通向香格里拉的道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once the diamond is placed at the top, it will point the way to Shangri-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.36,0:50:33.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,杨将军还拿着钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yang still has the diamond,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.49,0:50:36.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,他和龙帝一定会去那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's where he and the Emperor will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.03,0:50:38.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.16,0:50:41.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,关于神眼的所有传说都提到了入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the legends of the Eye mention the Gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.33,0:50:43.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,这姑娘不错 亚历克斯 她知道所有事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like her, Alex. She knows what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.58,0:50:49.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们相信你了 你能带我们去那吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, just say that we were to believe you, could you guide us there?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.17,0:50:52.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我去过一次 我记得路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I have been there once. I remember the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.42,0:50:57.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,喜马拉雅山 我们需要一架飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Himalayas. We're going to need a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.97,0:51:00.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道疯狗能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I know just the Mad Dog for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.14,0:51:07.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,任何有自尊的飞行员都会在谷底降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, any self-respecting pilot would land on the valley floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.15,0:51:08.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过我可没什么自尊可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't have any self-respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.98,0:51:11.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以我会在半山腰把你们放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I'll put you down halfway up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.32,0:51:13.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,那会对我们有利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should give us a good advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.15,0:51:15.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然 但我不能保证我们所有人都能活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, I can't guarantee any of us will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.32,0:51:16.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.28,0:51:24.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我该告诉你们系好安全带的 可我太穷了买不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd tell you to fasten your seatbelts, but I was too cheap to buy any!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.96,0:51:29.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我干嘛笑? - 到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why am I laughing? - Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.29,0:51:33.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,疯狗 疯狗! 慢点 慢点 慢点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mad Dog, Mad Dog! Ease up, ease up, ease up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.92,0:51:35.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.14,0:51:44.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,马奎尔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maguire!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.56,0:51:48.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,快啊朋友!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.60,0:51:49.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,疯狗!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mad Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.33,0:52:03.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,停下!不 不!大家不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brake! No, no! Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.08,0:52:06.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要动 大家都不要动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move, nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.26,0:52:22.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么恶心味道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that God-awful smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.85,0:52:25.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,牦牛吐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The yak yakked.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.94,0:52:32.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,恭迎皇上来到20世纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the modern world, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.81,0:52:34.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,唤朕何为?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you raise me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.15,0:52:39.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要陛下带领我们重振声威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this land. Only you can lead us back to greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.24,0:52:42.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,尔等何求?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.20,0:52:46.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,当阵将军 侍奉主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to serve as your general.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.70,0:52:50.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,上一个将军…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last general I trusted...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.46,0:52:53.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,背叛朕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.84,0:52:56.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,臣不会犯此错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not make that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.01,0:53:07.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,这泥之身无力唤醒大军…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot escape this curse until I am immortal...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.35,0:53:09.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.56,0:53:13.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,臣明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.86,0:53:17.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,故臣已获陛下长生秘诀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find the Pool of Eternal Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.61,0:53:22.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,此物能明示长生之道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will point the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.93,0:53:45.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see it's Mr McGuire 没看到是麦奎尔先生嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you see it's Mr McGuire
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.76,0:53:47.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,come to court your sister Kate 来向你妹妹凯特求爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come to court your sister Kate
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.68,0:53:51.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,You know very well he owns the farm a wee bit out 你知道他有一家农场一个小小的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know very well he owns the farm a wee bit out...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.11,0:54:07.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,德耳塔-探戈-阿尔法 呼叫跳飞 回答 跳飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MAGUIRE O VER RADIO... Delta-Tango-Alpha to Ricochet. Come in, Ricochet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.29,0:54:11.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,德耳塔-探戈-阿尔法 我是跳飞 说吧 疯狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Delta-Tango-Alpha, this is Ricochet. Go ahead, Mad Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.87,0:54:14.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 记得你要我留意的那个叫杨的家伙吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you know that Yang fellow you told me to keep me eye out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.42,0:54:15.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,他刚刚出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.71,0:54:17.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,跳飞明白 谢了 疯狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ricochet out. Thanks, Mad Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.04,0:54:19.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,该我们了 大伙!出发!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's us, people! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.80,0:54:21.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 乔纳森 醒醒! - 什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jonathan, wake up! - What...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.39,0:54:32.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,坚持下去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.48,0:54:37.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好 我们已经走了过半的路程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, we're a little more than halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.73,0:54:41.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在…今晚我们在那过夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna... We're gonna camp up there for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.04,0:54:58.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,琳说 如果我们在黎明出发 我们就能在中午前到达入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lin says if we leave at first light, we'll reach the Gateway by noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.84,0:55:03.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,她有没有说她是如何知道这么多入口的事的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she happen to mention how she knows so much about the Gateway?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.88,0:55:06.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,没 没有 她有点神秘兮兮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really. Kind of mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.47,0:55:10.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,显然她把你迷倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's certainly managed to enchant you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.39,0:55:15.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,得了 亚历克斯 你喜欢上她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Alex. You obviously like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.98,0:55:20.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 山上空气稀薄你也头脑发昏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, the thin mountain air, clearly messing with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.48,0:55:24.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,无论她藏着什么秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever secret she's hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.95,0:55:28.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不想看到你受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't want to see you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.16,0:55:31.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很感激 但是 你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate that, but, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.70,0:55:35.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对异性也有很多经验了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had my fair share of experience with the opposite sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.83,0:55:37.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.75,0:55:41.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,那有多少次经验了呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many experiences are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.84,0:55:48.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,不想知道答案就不该问 知道吗 妈妈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you shouldn't ask questions you don't want to know the answer to, okay, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.13,0:55:49.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.39,0:55:52.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.27,0:55:57.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉因木乃伊被唤醒的事而责怪你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I blamed you guys for raising the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.07,0:56:10.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.95,0:56:18.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我妈觉得我们之间有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother is under the impression there's something between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.41,0:56:20.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望不是什么浪漫的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope nothing romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.42,0:56:27.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊我跟她说没什么机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I told her there was no chance of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.09,0:56:29.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们完全是不一样的人 你和我 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're complete opposites, you and me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.55,0:56:34.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,你守护墓穴 而我是盗墓的 你喜欢古代刀剑 我喜欢枪支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guard tombs. I raid them. You like ancient knives. I'm into guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.31,0:56:37.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是不易改变的差异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are some pretty insurmountable odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.85,0:56:40.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 完全如此 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Absolutely. - Well, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.98,0:56:45.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,既然我们开诚布公了 我们就能专心消灭龙帝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that we've cleared that up, we can focus on taking down the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.27,0:56:46.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,完全同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.53,0:56:52.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有 你不是我喜欢的类型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, you're not my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.20,0:56:59.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 你不会喜欢一个能将你背摔的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not. You don't like a woman who can knock you on your backside.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.62,0:57:04.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,应该说"踢我的屁股"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The expression is "kick my ass."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.04,0:57:07.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,到目前为止你还没做过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for the record, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.26,0:57:13.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,哎 我真是不容易啊知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's not easy being me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.59,0:57:15.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,同样地 我想你也不容易吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then again, I don't suppose it's easy being you,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.39,0:57:17.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗 杰拉尔丁老姑娘?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it, Geraldine, old girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.64,0:57:19.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我遇上像你这样的女孩 杰拉尔丁…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'd met a girl like you, Geraldine...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.93,0:57:22.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,勤快 话不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, hard-working, you don't say much,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.90,0:57:27.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,毛比较多 但我不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're a little bit hairy, but I don't mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.41,0:57:40.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,在那!我们找到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is! We found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.63,0:57:50.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,香格里拉的入口!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Gateway of Shangri-La!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.18,0:58:02.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,走 姑娘!走!你自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, girl! Go! You're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.23,0:58:05.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 杰拉尔丁自由自在地活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Geraldine! Live free!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.62,0:58:18.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?抢劫武器?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do now? Rob an armoury?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.49,0:58:21.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你见过瓦尔特P38吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever seen a Walther P38?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.95,0:58:24.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,比调停者逊多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks pretty anaemic compared to the Peacekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.29,0:58:27.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是大小的问题 爸爸 而是火力的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not about size, Dad. It's about stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.17,0:58:31.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要火力?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want power?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.09,0:58:38.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,给你汤普森冲锋枪 50发一弹鼓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you the Thompson submachine gun. Fifty rounds a drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.30,0:58:41.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 25弹匣 - 是不错 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twenty-five a mag. - Tommy's good, Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.56,0:58:43.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,但击发装置老卡壳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the cocking mechanism always jams.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.35,0:58:47.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,来 看看俄罗斯产的PPS个人攻击武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Check out the Russian PPS Personal Assault Weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.81,0:58:49.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,这才是需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this is the future right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.61,0:58:52.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,靠经验才能成功 光靠火力是没用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's experience that wins the day. It's not all about firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.07,0:58:55.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,小伙子们!我可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys! If I may...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.11,0:58:56.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有什么计划对付龙帝吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have a plan for the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.07,0:58:59.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,有啊我们会又快又狠地将他打飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We're gonna hit him high, hard and fast
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.12,0:59:00.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后再把他当成明代花瓶一样打碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and smash him like a Ming vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.95,0:59:04.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果那没用呢? - 我们还有B计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And if that doesn't work? - We go to plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.16,0:59:07.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,B计划!你爬上去 然后炸了那座金塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan B! You go upstairs, you blow up that gold tower thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.42,0:59:09.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你点火 我们把他炸上天! - 我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You light it up. We blow the guy sky high! - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.63,0:59:10.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你!什么? - 爸爸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You! What? - Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.75,0:59:12.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们没炸死 也会被雪崩压死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if the explosion doesn't kill us, the avalanche will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.96,0:59:14.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有更好的主意? - 是的 有啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a better idea? - Yeah. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.55,0:59:16.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的想法是 用远程消音来复枪伏击他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we ambush him with long-range rifles and silencers.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.51,0:59:17.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,远程 很不错的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long-range, that's a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.68,0:59:18.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊我们可以慢慢靠近 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we can get in close, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.85,0:59:19.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 听起来不错 - 然后了结他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Much better idea. - And then we can finish him off
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.05,0:59:21.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 用琳的匕首 - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- with Lin's dagger. - Look, I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.76,0:59:24.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不太相信你女朋友的神奇匕首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't put much faith in your girlfriend's magic dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.52,0:59:26.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 爸爸 她不是我女朋友 - 你现在这么说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, Dad, she is not my girlfriend. - You say that now,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.81,0:59:28.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 但我还是不相信她 - 我信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but I still don't trust her. - Well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.98,0:59:31.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你该相信我的判断 知道吗? - 听着 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you should trust my judgement, okay? - Look, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.77,0:59:33.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,我干掉的木乃伊比你多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've put down more mummies in my time than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.53,0:59:34.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只干掉过一个 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put down one mummy, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.03,0:59:38.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊同一个木乃伊两次!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Same mummy twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.74,0:59:45.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,把绿线递给我 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand me the green wire, will you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.54,0:59:48.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有把握吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you know what you are doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.54,0:59:50.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我做过一百次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. I've done this a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.79,0:59:54.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果龙帝把神眼放在那上面 那什么都完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Emperor places the Eye up there, all will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.23,1:00:09.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,扫清障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear a path to the Golden Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.52,1:00:13.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,让朕见识一下 你是何等的良将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prove yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.82,1:00:20.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,火箭炮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.71,1:00:29.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,给他们来个热烈的奥康纳式欢迎!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give a warm O'Connell welcome!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.29,1:00:32.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,开火!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.79,1:00:34.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.06,1:00:49.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 火箭炮! - 开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bazooka! - [Chinese]
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.52,1:00:55.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.28,1:01:07.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯!跟我来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.01,1:01:21.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.01,1:01:24.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得干掉那些火箭炮!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta take out those bazookas!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.81,1:01:28.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.07,1:01:37.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 全跟我来 - 退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- [Chinese] - Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.98,1:01:40.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,快!快!快!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.58,1:01:50.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,实行B计划!炸了塔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go to plan B! Blow up the tower!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.12,1:01:52.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我对B计划不怎么放心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm actually a little bit concerned about plan B!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.08,1:01:53.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们直接进行C计划吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't we go straight to plan C?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.58,1:01:56.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,快去引爆它!我掩护你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just make it go bang! I'll cover you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.38,1:01:58.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.51,1:02:01.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走 走 走!快 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go, go, go! Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.84,1:02:03.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,快 哦 小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Oh, be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.49,1:02:25.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们右边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set up a crossfire!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.70,1:02:26.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,快! 右边小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.25,1:02:36.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,最后一弹匣!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My last round!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.18,1:02:50.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,耶缇 索特 快来啊! 耶缇 索特 快来啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.65,1:03:04.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 喜马拉雅雪人? - 西藏人管他们叫耶缇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Abominable snowmen? - The Tibetans call them yeti!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.95,1:03:10.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你们了!我需要你们的帮助!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.62,1:03:12.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,那些士兵是魔鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These soldiers are evil!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.84,1:03:16.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,她会说耶缇语?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She speaks Yeti?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.19,1:03:34.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,开火!把他们干掉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot! Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.70,1:03:45.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么老是我来做这种扭转乾坤的事!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I always have to save the day?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.12,1:03:47.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌得听从小孩的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate it when the kid's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.71,1:03:53.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,对付另一个家伙!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the other guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.33,1:03:55.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.90,1:04:22.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,敌人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.73,1:05:04.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,想慢慢地死还是痛快地死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can die slow or you can die fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.12,1:05:12.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,丑八怪!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.38,1:05:28.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,快!快!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.10,1:05:32.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,耶!我搞定了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.27,1:05:37.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 妈呀 我搞定了!该撤退了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mother, I did it! Time for a retreat, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.82,1:05:47.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一伙的!我是成员之一! "我为人人 人人为我"类似的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on your team! I'm a team player! "One for all and all for me" kind of thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.78,1:05:52.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,炸药 那些炸药!我们得离开这!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dynamite, all this dynamite! We should get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.13,1:06:09.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,退后!退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.97,1:06:11.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,跑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.33,1:06:42.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我恨木乃伊!他们从不公平对决!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate mummies! They never play fair!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.01,1:06:53.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸!爸爸 你要干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Dad, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.06,1:07:04.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里!这里!来啊!这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here! Over here! Come on! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.44,1:07:06.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.45,1:07:13.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,里克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.98,1:07:43.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,香格里拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shangri-La.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.66,1:07:54.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.87,1:07:58.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢那么大颗钻石!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could use a diamond like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.14,1:08:22.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.36,1:08:31.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 坚持 坚持住爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, hold it. Hold on there, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.99,1:08:35.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的 求你了 求求你 求求你 坚持住好不好 爸爸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, please, please, please put pressure on it, okay, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.20,1:08:38.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 没事的 再糟糕的都经历过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, it's all right. We've been in tougher scrapes than this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.08,1:08:46.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,雪崩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.28,1:09:21.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮我!帮帮我! - 琳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help! Help me! - Lin!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.54,1:09:28.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,求求你们!帮帮我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.75,1:10:11.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.46,1:10:15.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了!我还活着!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got it! And I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.88,1:10:21.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,帮我 求求你们 谁来帮帮我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, please. Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.18,1:10:25.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们在这里!在这里! - 亚历克斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're over here! Over here! - Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.10,1:10:27.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 妈妈 我们在下面 - 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom, Mom, we're down here! - Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.02,1:10:29.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.87,1:10:43.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.58,1:10:48.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得马上带他到香格里拉! 这是我们的最后机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to take him to Shangri-La now! It's our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.02,1:11:09.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.29,1:11:28.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,那池子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.80,1:11:40.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.47,1:11:43.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,小宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sweet daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.40,1:11:53.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,求求你…求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg you...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.23,1:11:57.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father is dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.57,1:11:58.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.86,1:12:01.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.61,1:12:02.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.57,1:12:38.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.36,1:12:43.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,他需要休息 带他去我的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must rest. We'll take him to my chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.38,1:13:04.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪 将军?命运等着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going, General? Our destiny awaits.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.10,1:13:14.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是所有人的妹夫都能死里逃生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not everyone that gets their brother-in-law back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.44,1:13:18.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一生80年中给我那么十天就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, give me my four score years and ten any day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.78,1:13:25.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是香格里拉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this Shangri-La?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.62,1:13:38.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以住这 机会多多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could live here. Lots of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.46,1:13:41.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个娱乐场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A casino.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.84,1:13:50.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,让你参与我的复仇计划是一个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong to involve you in my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.72,1:13:52.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.31,1:13:55.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,您让我干什么都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.78,1:14:07.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在休息了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's resting well. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.91,1:14:11.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们是怎么卷进来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get involved in all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.41,1:14:16.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇帝杀了我唯一爱过的男人 琳的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor murdered the only man I ever loved, Lin's father.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.96,1:14:20.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,要不是耶缇发现了我 把我带到这池子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have died, too, by his hand,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.88,1:14:24.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我应该也被他杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the yeti had not found me and brought me to this pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.88,1:14:27.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这是如何发生的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on a second. How did this all happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.05,1:14:30.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,这都是公元前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was before Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.97,1:14:35.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,你守卫这个墓穴多久了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long were you guarding his tomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.85,1:14:37.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,超过两千年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over 2,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.69,1:14:45.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能让皇帝靠近这个池子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor must never be allowed to reach the Pool,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.07,1:14:48.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,否则他就有力量召集他的军队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or he will have the power to raise his army.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.07,1:14:50.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,一旦他变成不死之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once he becomes immortal,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.78,1:14:54.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,他将成为前所未有的邪恶生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he can transform himself into the most hideous creatures ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.91,1:14:57.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我先去守护入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take the first watch at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.59,1:15:08.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道嘛 我不介意和老女人约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I have no problem dating an older woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.01,1:15:13.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕我们不能在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid we can't be together.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.26,1:15:16.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等 什么?为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.56,1:15:21.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是不死之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm going to live forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.85,1:15:24.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不要看着你死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to watch you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.11,1:15:26.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样?就因为这个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.94,1:15:30.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想就这样算了 就这样永生吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just gonna sit on the sidelines for eternity?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.07,1:15:34.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,母亲为父亲伤心了好几个世纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother has mourned my father for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.74,1:15:37.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道自己是否能承受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if my heart can bear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.12,1:15:45.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,人无法在哀伤中过一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People can live an entire lifetime in one look.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.51,1:15:49.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的父母就是这样过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watch my parents do it every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.09,1:15:54.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.64,1:15:58.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲醒了 上来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's awake. Get up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.07,1:16:12.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.20,1:16:18.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是天堂 那还真是不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is heaven, it looks pretty good so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.59,1:16:29.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴看到某些永恒的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to see some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.27,1:16:49.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,对他宽容点 他吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go easy on him. He feels terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.45,1:16:57.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你躺在那里时 爸爸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I saw you lying there, Dad...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.28,1:17:01.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从没这么害怕过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been so scared in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.75,1:17:05.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.04,1:17:09.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你不会死的 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you know, you're not supposed to die, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.09,1:17:11.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可是跳飞?奥康纳 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Ricochet O'Connell, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.21,1:17:14.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你被打被摔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get beat up, you get tossed around,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.55,1:17:17.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,但最后你仍是站在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, well, you're always standing there in the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.26,1:17:20.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过没有你的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never really thought of the world without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.14,1:17:25.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.56,1:17:29.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,实际上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the truth is,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.78,1:17:33.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.61,1:17:37.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.66,1:17:38.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想当一个好丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to be a good husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.95,1:17:40.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想当一个好父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to be a good parent.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.41,1:17:44.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,而事实是 最近我做错了 而且…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the truth is, I've been dropping the ball lately, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.08,1:17:47.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是的 你知道 我不是一个好儿子 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you know, I haven't been the world's greatest son, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.12,1:17:51.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 那都是遗传自你妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, that's 'cause you get it from her side of the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.25,1:17:52.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.30,1:17:57.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.22,1:18:05.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看来好累了 你得休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look tired, you should rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.06,1:18:07.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.40,1:18:10.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,命运快到最后的决战时刻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fate is about to deal its final hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.90,1:18:13.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是我们想击败皇帝…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we are to defeat the Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.48,1:18:17.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得要求你再做出一次牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must ask for one more sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.53,1:18:18.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么都行 母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything, mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.70,1:18:22.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,献出你的永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your immortality.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.76,1:18:37.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不!他的力量完全恢复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! His powers have been fully restored!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.47,1:18:38.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,行动吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.41,1:19:04.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,郭明的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Ming's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.62,1:19:07.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your child will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.76,1:19:18.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是不死之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.45,1:19:50.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!你这三头怪物 狗娘养的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! You three-headed shape-shifting son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.43,1:20:02.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,琳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lin!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.44,1:20:14.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.32,1:20:19.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.58,1:20:30.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,他带她回墓穴召集军队去了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taking her back to his tomb to raise his army!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.87,1:20:34.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 有没有更快的方法赶到那? - 耶缇 他们能帮上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there a faster way down from here? - The yeti. They'll help.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.08,1:20:36.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,可他已经飞上天了 太晚了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's already in the air. It'll be too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.25,1:20:40.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,疯狗飞得可比这三头蜥蜴快多了!我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mad Dog can outfly a three-headed lizard any day of the week! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.80,1:20:47.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,左边!9点钟方向!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Portside! Nine o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.94,1:20:57.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,里克?我是不是该戒酒了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick? Should I quit drinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.49,1:21:04.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,乔纳森呼叫里克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O VER RADIO... Jonathan to Rick.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.61,1:21:06.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们想把他打回墓穴 你们最好快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd better get a move on if you're gonna beat him to the tomb!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.70,1:21:09.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊是啊你尽快带增援回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, just get back here as fast as you can with the reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.49,1:21:11.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要看风景了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sightseeing!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.79,1:21:15.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,给你 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.62,1:21:16.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我? - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that for me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.75,1:21:17.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.71,1:21:22.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要兵马俑军队没越过长城 我们还可以击败他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Terracotta Army is not indestructible until it crosses the Great Wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.80,1:21:26.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 到底我们该如何阻止他们呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's comforting. How exactly are we supposed to fend them off?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.26,1:21:27.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇帝建造长城时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the Emperor built the Wall,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.60,1:21:28.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他的敌人都埋在城墙下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he buried his enemies underneath it
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.06,1:21:31.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,并诅咒他们的灵魂永世不得超生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and cursed their souls to hold it up for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.56,1:21:36.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,大部分是被打败的士兵 我会召唤他们再次战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of them were conquered soldiers. I will call them to battle once again.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.56,1:21:42.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,打开祭坛 召唤军队 这计划不错 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlock an altar, raise an army. That sounds like a plan. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.01,1:22:10.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab her.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.89,1:22:12.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 看紧她 - 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guard her with your life. - [Chinese]
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.69,1:22:16.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.19,1:22:21.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他人呢? - 你觉得呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd he go? - Where do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.54,1:22:41.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,醒来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AWAKE!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.39,1:24:19.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,尔等醒于今…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today you awake to a world...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.27,1:24:22.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,止世上混乱腐败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the grip of chaos and corruption.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.73,1:24:24.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,打开通往过去的入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the gates of the past
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.90,1:24:27.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,释放受害者的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and free the souls of the wrongfully damned.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.15,1:24:30.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,必恢复法制…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will restore order...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.74,1:24:33.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,朕 必须夺回天下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will retake what is mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.74,1:24:36.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,绝自由于患\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will crush any idea of freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.49,1:24:39.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,以祖先和正义之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of the ancestors and the righteous,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.70,1:24:43.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,献上我与女儿的永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sacrifice my immortality and that of my daughter
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.17,1:24:45.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,来让你们复活!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that you may rise this day!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.17,1:24:47.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,朕召尔等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will slaughter without mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.38,1:24:49.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,威望广施正义于天下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will conquer without compassion.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.21,1:24:52.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,尔等随朕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will now lead you past the Great Wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.93,1:24:56.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,跨越长城 长生不老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you cross, you will be indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.47,1:25:02.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,熄灭被压迫者对暴君及其追随者的怒火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring down the wrath of the oppressed on this Emperor and all who follow him!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.14,1:25:05.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,攻占城池!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I raised you for one purpose...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.56,1:25:08.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,大开杀戒 毫不留情!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to enforce my will on the entire world!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.98,1:25:10.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇上万岁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.03,1:25:16.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我召唤你们 成千上万的冤魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call upon the hundreds and the thousands
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.49,1:25:21.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,把握此刻 赢得胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you may rise up and seize this moment to take your victory,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.45,1:25:25.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,以正义之名 报仇雪恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take your justice and to take your revenge!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.27,1:25:45.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,紫苑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zi Yuan.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.19,1:25:53.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,明将军!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's General Ming!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.24,1:25:55.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟随明将军!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow General Ming!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.16,1:26:03.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,备战!备战!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.55,1:26:15.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些是…他们是不死的好人 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are... They're good undead guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.05,1:26:19.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.18,1:26:21.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,紫苑!紫苑!紫苑派我们来的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zi Yuan! Zi Yuan! Zi Yuan sent us!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.56,1:26:25.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 我不觉得他会说英语 - 我们站在紫苑这边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Darling, I don't think he speaks English. - We're with Zi Yuan!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.89,1:26:27.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,紫苑?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zi Yuan?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.73,1:26:28.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.65,1:26:31.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.94,1:26:34.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,战斗!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To battle!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.84,1:26:58.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,自由!自由!自由!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freedom! Freedom! Freedom!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.80,1:27:03.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,换箭阵!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Archers form up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.60,1:27:08.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.16,1:27:26.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿!那是我最喜欢的蓝衬衫 - 我一直不喜欢那件衬衫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! That's my favourite blue shirt. - I've always hated that shirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.00,1:27:35.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对不起 啊 对不起 对不起 你头在这 你头在这
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.55,1:27:44.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,灭郭明!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death to General Ming!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.18,1:27:49.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.78,1:28:01.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到20世纪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the 20th century!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.76,1:28:21.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,向右翼进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let them cross the wall!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.93,1:29:49.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你已非不死之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are no longer immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.35,1:30:33.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的!退回高地!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey! Fall back to higher ground!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.77,1:30:42.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很讨厌木乃伊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really hate mummies!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.19,1:30:44.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也是!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems the feeling's mutual!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.28,1:30:50.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 粘土小子 砍你的头!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, clay boy! Fore!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.03,1:30:52.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.13,1:31:06.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 接住! - 拿到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Catch! - Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.76,1:31:13.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,下次我说"比这个更糟的都经历过" 就是指这次!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time I say, "We've been in tougher scrapes than this," I mean this!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.79,1:31:42.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,去死 你们这群木乃伊混蛋!都去死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die, you mummy bastards! Die!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.21,1:31:45.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,没必要说脏话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no call for bad language!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.51,1:31:50.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,乔纳森真能把握入场时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan certainly knows how to make an entrance!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.37,1:32:19.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,有遗憾吗 亲爱的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any regrets, darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.29,1:32:23.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,没 永远不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None. Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.68,1:32:35.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们没事吧? - 当然 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Yeah, sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.68,1:32:38.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,完全在我们的控制之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had it completely under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.02,1:32:43.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙怎么那么多花招?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy ever run out of tricks?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.11,1:32:49.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.66,1:32:58.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,母亲!不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.00,1:33:02.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,母亲!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.21,1:33:09.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,母亲!母亲!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.81,1:33:21.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,刺穿他的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pierce through his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.65,1:33:29.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你得活着 战斗下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must live and fight on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.54,1:33:51.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,她说刺穿心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said through the heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.21,1:33:53.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,刺穿心脏 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through the heart. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.65,1:34:08.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,快上车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.61,1:34:12.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥康纳他们要去刺杀皇上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The O'Connells are going to stop the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.95,1:34:26.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 有计划了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Dad, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.46,1:34:27.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,声东击西!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Divide and conquer!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.04,1:34:31.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用攻击 是不是太简单了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No offence, but isn't that a little short on detail?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.84,1:34:34.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 十二点方向下面! - 抓紧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twelve o'clock low! - Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.60,1:34:44.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,记得我们说好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember our deal!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.10,1:34:46.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,一切结束后 请我们喝酒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When this is over, my men get to drink for free!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.81,1:34:49.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,整个酒吧拿去都没问题!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can have the whole damn bar for all I care!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.81,1:34:52.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想呆在中国!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting the hell out of China.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.35,1:35:26.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,当初是我挖你出来的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dug you up...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.73,1:35:30.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我要赶你回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm gonna put you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.51,1:36:04.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯?亚历克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex? Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.24,1:37:05.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,放开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.41,1:37:06.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.41,1:37:13.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,把戏玩够了!你的骄傲呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough tricks! Where's your honour?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.50,1:37:18.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,像个男人一样打一场!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight like a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.96,1:37:58.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,声东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Divide
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.21,1:38:01.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,击西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and conquer.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.34,1:38:51.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,去地府当你的皇帝吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you can rule in hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.54,1:39:19.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇帝死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.58,1:39:21.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,皇帝死了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor is dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.17,1:40:12.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 姑娘们 你们好漂亮 - 晚上好 马奎尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Evening, girls. You're looking well. - Good evening, Mr Maguire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.18,1:40:16.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是个不错的夜晚 - 就一个老女人来说 你跳得很好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a fine night to be me. - You dance great for an old lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.52,1:40:20.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,有人叫我放开自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone told me to stop living on the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.14,1:40:23.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 听起来是个聪明的家伙 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, he sounds like a smart guy. - He is.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.20,1:40:38.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我猜达什和斯嘉丽又有了新的冒险?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I guess Dash and Scarlet have their next adventure?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.79,1:40:41.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,都经历过了 干嘛还写?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why write about it when you can live it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.79,1:40:47.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,打败木乃伊时发生不少浪漫故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something incredibly romantic about vanquishing the undead.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.84,1:40:50.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,特别是和你在一起的那些更浪漫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even more romantic doing it with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.22,1:40:54.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 吻我 - 不用问我第二次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kiss me. - Don't have to ask me twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.19,1:41:04.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 要我帮你拿包吗 先生? - 不 不 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I get your bag, sir? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.94,1:41:06.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,别碰 不要碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch it, don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.02,1:41:08.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪 卡纳汉先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you off to, Mr Carnahan?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.15,1:41:10.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有木乃伊的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace where they don't have mummies.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.61,1:41:13.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点!我要赶飞机 - 是 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Step on it! I've got a plane to catch. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.53,1:41:17.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,耶 再见 再见 上海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Ciao, ciao, Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.28,1:41:19.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,秘鲁 我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peru, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.46,1:41:26.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,不久之后 秘鲁发现了木乃伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon after, mummies were found in Peru.
